<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-2ihjue-e0003h-s " data-id="e0003h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-2ihjue-e0003i-s " data-id="e0003i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003i">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003j" class="e-2ihjue-e0003j-s e-heading-base">What I do</h2>
					<p class="e-2ihjue-e0003k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003k">Titles, systems in motion, broadcast packages — and the odd character job.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003l e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-2ihjue-e0003l-s " data-id="e0003l" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-2ihjue-e0003m-s " data-id="e0003m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003m">
    			<p class="e-2ihjue-e0003n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003n">A</p>
					<p class="e-2ihjue-e0003o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003o">Title sequences and end frames</p>
					<p class="e-2ihjue-e0003p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003p">The first 400 milliseconds, then the last eight. Boards, style frames, final animation and the delivery matrix.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-2ihjue-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q">
    			<p class="e-2ihjue-e0003r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003r">B</p>
					<p class="e-2ihjue-e0003s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003s">Brand motion systems</p>
					<p class="e-2ihjue-e0003t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003t">With real documentation, not a Figma page of gifs. Timing curves, entry and exit rules, a spec your team can build against.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-2ihjue-e0003u-s " data-id="e0003u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003u">
