    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005b" class="e-2ihjue-e0005b-s e-heading-base">How I work with a studio, versus direct</h2>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005c e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-2ihjue-e0005c-s " data-id="e0005c" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-2ihjue-e0005d-s " data-id="e0005d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005d">
    			<p class="e-2ihjue-e0005e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005e">With a studio</p>
					<p class="e-2ihjue-e0005f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005f">I slot in as a designer and animator, and take direction.</p>
					<p class="e-2ihjue-e0005g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005g">Your creative director leads, I deliver inside your pipeline and your naming conventions. No client-facing noise from me unless you want me in the room.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-2ihjue-e0005h-s " data-id="e0005h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005h">
    			<p class="e-2ihjue-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">Direct with a brand</p>
					<p class="e-2ihjue-e0005j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005j">One strategy conversation before I open After Effects.</p>
					<p class="e-2ihjue-e0005k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005k">I insist on it, and it is included. It is ninety minutes that saves a fortnight of animating the wrong idea beautifully.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
